 "harness_faults_found_and_fixed": [
  "The stub omitted meta.action, so productPricing.siteUniverse.get was refused RESPONSE_ACTION_MISMATCH — a harness shape fault that would have read as a PSB defect.",
  "The site-universe fixture carried only `sites`; the validator also requires `refusals`, `sourceState` and a schema contract_version. It refused RESPONSE_MISSING_REFUSALS.",
  "fcSummary reads were keyed by ACTION alone, so a cold FC entry reported 1 duplicate. The two reads are the bootstrap slice and the regular slice — two different questions. Keyed by slice, the duplicate count is 0 and the earlier reading was the harness being too coarse.",
  "The fc_regular_forecast fixture used target_year; the normalizer reads `year`."
 ],
 "not_measured_here": {
  "FC_ENTRY_TO_FIRST_ROWS": "The FC table refuses to draw until a year is chosen (fc-year-select ships with a blank option selected), so the harness could not reach a populated table without simulating that choice, and its attempt to set the value was overwritten when the slice landed and the filter options were rebuilt. Recorded as an OBSERVATION for the operator smoke rather than as a defect: no evidence was obtained that the rebuild is unintended, and this round does not change behaviour it has not proven wrong."
 }
}
